    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Department of Community Health Sciences, in collaboration with the National Institute of Health (NIH), hosted a dissemination event in Islamabad on September 26, 2025, to share insights from the project Institutionalizing Learning by Mainstreaming Embedded Implementation Research in Country Immunization Programmes (MAINSTREAM). Supported by the Alliance for Health Policy and Systems Research (AHPSR), Gavi, the Vaccine Alliance, and the World Health Organization (WHO), the initiative is designed to generate context-driven solutions, build workforce capacity, and ensure equity in immunization coverage.",
